镜、遮阳帽、防晒霜)、登山杖 (只走登山步道可带双杖，计划进入后程野路可带单杖辅助或不带)。\n饮食：建议轻装，每人1.5L水 (包含一瓶电解质饮料)，一顿中午的路餐 (山饭，三明治，泡面等均可) 和一些高能量小零食即可。 \n⚠️注意事项\n防火要求：舞彩浅山是重点防火区，禁止携带任何火源进山。\n离线地图：本期路线后程有野山路段，部分区域没有信号！提前准备好离线轨迹，全程紧盯轨迹防迷路 (某路编号：26595087)\n无痕山林：野外路段没有垃圾桶，产生的垃圾请全部装进垃圾袋带回市区，保护环境！ \n#北京 #北京徒步 #徒步 #北京周边游#户外","album_image":"https://p11-sign.douyinpic.com/tos-cn-i-dy/18789ea414614941832f2c7b3f60af7b~tplv-dy-resize-walign-adapt-aq:540:q75.jpeg?lk3s=138a59ce&x-expires=1787025600&x-signature=cbRa7h9QyfZku3z1vMieg4h9QLk%3D&from=327834062&s=PackSourceEnum_SEARCH&se=false&sc=cover&biz_tag=aweme_video&l=20260804124328F35BF79ABF5E5F0DEEE4","album_image_height":721,"album_image_width":540,"album_image_uri":"tos-cn-i-dy/18789ea414614941832f2c7b3f60af7b","host_page_url":"","video":{"height":640,"width":360,"origin_cover":{"uri":"tos-cn-p-0015/oEnwADIggBATLdlelfLaWyeREnnYaBAhGCv7HO","url_list":["https://p3-sign.douyinpic.com/tos-cn-p-0015/oEnwADIggBATLdlelfLaWyeREnnYaBAhGCv7HO~tplv-dy-360p.jpeg?lk3s=138a59ce&x-expires=1787025600&x-signature=iyYRqUyqcD0ac9YUnjBMHbECZSM%3D&from=327834062&s=PackSourceEnum_SEARCH&se=false&sc=origin_cover&biz_tag=aweme_video&l=20260804124328F35BF79ABF5E5F0DEEE4","https://p26-sign.douyinpic.com/tos-cn-p-0015/oEnwADIggBATLdlelfLaWyeREnnYaBAhGCv7HO~tplv-dy-360p.jpeg?lk3s=138a59ce&x-expires=1787025600&x-signature=HS0qAOHA%2FO8SYWtW5ZjvJl7XuqY%3D&from=327834062&s=PackSourceEnum_SEARCH&se=false&sc=origin_cover&biz_tag=aweme_video&l=20260804124328F35BF79ABF5E5F0DEEE4","https://p11-sign.douyinpic.com/tos-cn-p-0015/oEnwADIggBATLdlelfLaWyeREnnYaBAhGCv7HO~tplv-dy-360p.jpeg?lk3s=138a59ce&x-expires=1787025600&x-signature=REr7bxQyymIJigHbcYyEgYLKmuw%3D&from=327834062&s=PackSourceEnum_SEARCH&se=false&sc=origin_cover&biz_tag=aweme_video&l=20260804124328F35BF79ABF5E5F0DEEE4"],"width":360,"height":640}}},{"gid":"7624459272470966185","video_captions":"上山净化心灵，下山享受人间烟火，今日徒步春天的舞彩浅山#舞彩浅山 #山顶的风景值得一看 #创作者中心 #创作灵感 #上山净化心灵，下山享受人间烟火","album_image":"https://p11-sign.douyinpic.com/tos-cn-p-0015/o4xDENhY6BAUh8u